  "final_answer": "I have successfully completed the task. Here's the answer:\n\n## Course Found: **生成式人工智能：影响、考虑因素和伦理问题 (Generative AI: Impact, Considerations, and Ethical Issues)**\n\n**This course perfectly matches all the requirements:**\n\n| Criteria | Result |\n|----------|--------|\n| **Topic** | AI Ethics ✓ (Generative AI ethics, including data privacy, bias, copyright, hallucinations, and deepfakes) |\n| **Duration** | **6 hours** ✓ (Less than 20 hours) |\n| **Rating** | **4.8 stars** ✓ (4+ stars) |\n| **Provider** | IBM (IBM Skills Network Team) |\n| **Level** | Beginner |\n| **Reviews** | 342 ratings |\n| **Enrollment** | 35,705 students |\n| **Modules** | 3 modules with 6 assignments |\n\n### Other Notable AI Ethics Courses Found (1-4 weeks):\n- **责任人工智能简介 (Introduction to Responsible AI)** by Google Cloud - 4.7 stars (1085 reviews) - 1-4 weeks\n- **人工智能：伦理与社会挑战 (AI: Ethics and Social Challenges)** by Lund University - 4.7 stars (388 reviews) - 1-4 weeks - FREE\n- **AI Ethics** by Alex Genadinik - 4.6 stars (11 reviews) - 1-4 weeks\n\n### How I Found It:\n1. Searched \"artificial intelligence ethics\" on Coursera\n2. Applied duration filters: \"少于 2 小时\" (Less than 2 hours) and \"1-4 周\" (1-4 weeks)\n3. Verified course details including actual hours (6 hours) and star rating (4.8) by clicking through to the course page\n\nThe IBM course \"Generative AI: Impact, Considerations, and Ethical Issues\" is the best match as it's specifically focused on AI ethics, completed in just 6 hours, and has an outstanding 4.8-star rating from 342 participants.",
